312	\section{Principal Achievement of the Paper}
313	The paper establishes a comprehensive and unifying geometric bridge between two cornerstones of non-perturbative string theory: matrix theory and the AdS/CFT correspondence. Its core achievements include:
314	\begin{enumerate}
