531	\end{enumerate}
532	\section{Principal Drawback of the Paper}
533	The principal drawback of the paper lies in the incomplete dynamical and physical foundation of the non-Lorentzian bulk geometries ($\text{DLCQ}^n$ with $n \ge 1$) and the restriction of the worldvolume $T\bar{T}$ deformations to the classical, bosonic, abelian regime. This manifests in three closely related technical limitations:
